# Managed by LINDS-Ansible: roles/router/files/jd/etc/suricata/threshold.config.
# jd-torrent-01 (10.0.50.24, a Kea reservation) is the torrent client. These
# rules fire on its normal work: 11,345 of the 20,957 alerts in the 24 h to
# 2026-10-20 13:30. Suppressed for that host only; every other host still
# raises them. Suricata reads this file on a rule reload.
# P2P policy rules
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2102181, track by_src, ip 10.0.50.24
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2008581, track by_src, ip 10.0.50.24
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2008585, track by_src, ip 10.0.50.24
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2010144, track by_src, ip 10.0.50.24
# Protocol anomalies of its peer traffic (TLS record type, one-direction
# protocol detection, QUIC data errors), in either direction
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2230002, track by_either, ip 10.0.50.24
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2260002, track by_either, ip 10.0.50.24
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2231001, track by_either, ip 10.0.50.24
